      "stage": "Lead-in",
      "time": "5 minutes",
      "activity_description": "Review Oersted's experiment (electricity generates magnetism). Ask students: 'Can magnetism generate electricity?' Show historical context (Faraday's quest)."
    },
    {
      "stage": "Experiment Exploration",
      "time": "15 minutes",
      "activity_description": "Students work in groups. Equipment: Coil, Bar Magnet, Sensitive Galvanometer. Tasks: 1. Move magnet into coil. 2. Move magnet out of coil. 3. Keep magnet stationary inside coil. 4. Vary speed of movement. Record galvanometer readings."
