    "Evidence supporting Continental Drift (Jigsaw fit, fossil distribution, rock sequences, paleoclimate).",
    "The structure of the Earth's lithosphere and asthenosphere.",
    "Three types of plate boundaries: Divergent, Convergent, and Transform.",
    "Mechanism of plate movement (Mantle Convection)."
  ],
