        "interaction": "Think-Pair-Share"
      },
      {
        "phase": "Visual Exploration",
        "duration": "20 minutes",
        "description": "Use graphing software (e.g., GeoGebra or Desmos 3D) to show level curves of f(x,y) and the constraint curve g(x,y)=c. Demonstrate visually where the level curve touches the constraint curve tangentially.",
