      },
      {
        "phase": "Derivation & Formalism",
        "duration": "25 minutes",
        "description": "Guide students through the derivation of ∇f = λ∇g based on the tangency condition. Define the Lagrangian function L(x, y, λ) = f(x, y) - λ(g(x, y) - c).",
