        "description": "Work through a specific example: Maximize f(x,y) = xy subject to x² + y² = 8. Walk through setting up equations, solving for x, y, and λ, and comparing values.",
        "interaction": "Collaborative Problem Solving"
      },
      {
        "phase": "Summary & Reflection",
        "duration": "10 minutes",
        "description": "Summarize the steps. Discuss the meaning of λ (e.g., if surface area budget increases by 1 unit, how much does volume increase?).",
        "interaction": "Q&A Session"
      }
    ],
    "example_problem": {
