      "Differentiating between standard conditions (1 M, 1 atm, 25\u00b0C) and non-standard conditions."
    ],
    "classroom_activity_design": {
      "phase_1_introduction": {
        "time_minutes": 15,
        "description": "Teacher demonstrates a simple lemon battery or copper-zinc cell connected to a voltmeter. Ask students to observe the needle deflection and hypothesize what causes the electricity.",
