      "Two core properties: Optimal Substructure and Overlapping Subproblems.",
      "Top-Down Approach (Memoization): Caching results of recursive calls.",
      "Bottom-Up Approach (Tabulation): Iteratively building solutions from base cases.",
      "Time and Space Complexity analysis of DP solutions."
    ],
    "difficulties": [
      "Identifying when a problem can be solved using DP versus Greedy or Divide & Conquer.",
      "Correctly defining the 'State' (what variables represent the subproblem).",
