      },
      {
        "phase": "Concept Explanation",
        "time": "25 Minutes",
        "description": "Explain Optimal Substructure and Overlapping Subproblems. Show the transformation from Naive Recursion -> Memoization (Top-Down) -> Tabulation (Bottom-Up). Use a grid visualization to show how subproblems fill up."
      },
