        "correct_answer": "It reduces photorespiration in hot/dry conditions"
      }
    ],
    "required_resources": [
      "Projector and Slides (showing Kranz anatomy and biochemical pathways)",
      "Handouts with unlabeled C4 pathway diagrams",
      "Colored pencils/markers",
      "Textbook reference on Plant Physiology"
    ]
  }
