      "Differentiating between Risk Aversion in EUT and Loss Aversion in Behavioral Economics.",
      "Grasping the concept of Reference Dependence (decisions are made relative to a status quo, not absolute wealth).",
      "Applying abstract psychological concepts to quantitative economic models."
    ],
    "classroom_activity_design": {
      "activity_1": {
