      "Reflective essay: Describe a personal decision influenced by framing or loss aversion.",
      "In-class participation during the gambling experiments."
    ],
    "recommended_resources": [
      "Kahneman, D., & Tversky, A. (1979). Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk.",
      "Thaler, R. H. (2015). Misbehaving: The Making of Behavioral Economics.",
      "Video: Daniel Kahneman - Thinking, Fast and Slow (TED Talk)."
    ]
  }
}

