        "Ask groups to plot these items on a 2x2 matrix (Excludable vs. Non-Excludable; Rivalrous vs. Non-Rivalrous).",
        "Groups must justify their classification for ambiguous items (e.g., Is a congested toll road rivalrous?).",
        "Class review and correction led by the instructor."
      ],
      "learning_outcome": "Ability to categorize goods and distinguish public goods from other types."
