        "Split class into 'Pro-Government Intervention' and 'Private Sector Solution'.",
        "Teams prepare arguments based on market failure theory.",
        "Hold a structured debate focusing on efficiency and equity."
      ],
      "learning_outcome": "Application of theory to policy evaluation and critical thinking."
    }
