      "Differentiating between 'past consideration' and a condition attached to a current promise.",
      "Grasping the nuance between the strict rule in Stilk v Myrick and the practical benefit test in Williams v Roffey Bros.",
      "Applying Promissory Estoppel correctly, noting it acts as a shield rather than a cause of action."
    ],
    "classroom_activity_design": [
      {
        "activity_name": "Case Law Comparison Workshop",
        "description": "Split class into two groups. Group A summarizes Stilk v Myrick (1809). Group B summarizes Williams v Roffey Bros (1990). Groups debate how the law regarding existing duties has shifted over time.",
