        "method": "Formative Assessment",
        "details": "Observation of group discussions and participation in the role-play simulation."
      },
      {
        "method": "Summative Assessment",
        "details": "A short reflective essay (500 words) analyzing a real-world policy where bureaucracy played a critical role."
      },
      {
        "method": "Quiz",
        "details": "Multiple-choice questions testing definitions of key terms (e.g., street-level bureaucracy, implementation gap)."
      }
