    "Role of Cytochrome P450 enzymes in drug metabolism (Poor, Intermediate, Extensive, Ultra-rapid metabolizers).",
    "Clinical examples: Warfarin (VKORC1/CYP2C9), Clopidogrel (CYP2C19), Abacavir (HLA-B*5701).",
    "Integration of PGx data into Electronic Health Records (EHR).",
    "Current guidelines (e.g., CPIC, DPWG)."
  ],
  "difficulties": [
    "Understanding complex polygenic influences on drug response versus single-gene effects.",
    "Interpreting conflicting genetic test results in the context of comorbidities and polypharmacy.",
    "Navigating the cost-effectiveness and accessibility barriers of PGx testing.",
    "Addressing patient privacy concerns regarding genetic data storage and usage."
  ],
  "classroom_activity_design": {
