    },
    {
      "activity_name": "Mythic Method Workshop",
      "time_minutes": 30,
      "description": "Compare a scene from Homer's Odyssey with a corresponding chapter summary from Joyce's Ulysses. Discuss how the ancient myth elevates or ironizes the mundane modern action.",
