      "Types of Plasticity: Structural (changes in gray matter volume, dendritic branching) vs. Functional (changes in activation patterns, cortical remapping).",
      "Mechanisms: Long-term potentiation (LTP), synaptic pruning, axonal sprouting, and unmasking of latent pathways.",
      "Principles of Training: Specificity, Repetition, Intensity, Salience, and Time-dependence.",
