        "challenge": "Individual Variability",
        "description": "Understanding why neuroplastic responses vary significantly between patients due to age, genetics, and lesion location."
      },
      {
        "challenge": "Misconceptions",
        "description": "Correcting the myth that neuroplasticity only occurs in childhood or that 'use it or lose it' applies universally without nuance."
