        "step_id": 3,
        "action": "Set Up Optimization Problem",
        "instruction": "Construct the Lagrangian function to maximize utility subject to the IBC. The function is L = ln(C1) + beta*ln(C2) + lambda*(W - C1 - C2/(1 + r)), where lambda is the Lagrange multiplier."
      },
